<title>NETHERLANDS: Ahold's Schuitema '96 turnover up 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Ahold's Schuitema '96 turnover up 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMERSFOORT, Netherlands 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schuitema NV, a 73 percent owned wholesaling unit of Dutch retail group Ahold NV, said on Thursday its 1996 turnover had risen by 4.1 percent to 3.19 billion guilders.  </p>
<p>Turnover of the independent supermarkets which are supplied by Schuitema rose by 3.7 percent to 4.11 billion guilders and their market share in the Netherlands rose to 10.3 percent from 10.2 percent.</p>
<p>The number of supermarkets fell by 16 to 486 but the total size in square metres rose and their average weekly turnover grew by 5.1 percent to 159,450 guilders, Schuitema said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
